docs {
Setujui kontribusi oleh verifikator (admin/root/reviewer): entity jadi
published + is_verified true (+ verified_by/at untuk kata; anak-anak kata
ikut keputusan). Baris contribution_reviews dibuat, contributions.status
jadi 'approved'. Audit action "approve" (Section 21).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "contribution_id": "01JDContribution0000000000",
        "entity_type": "word",
        "entity_id": "01JDKALINTIAK0000000000",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    }

Setelah approve, GET /words/:id kata tsb → 200 (sudah tayang).
}

meta {
  name: Approve Contribution
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/contributions/{{contribution_id}}/approve
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "comment": "Valid, silakan tayang"
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + status approved", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('approved');
    expect(res.body.data.entity_type).to.equal('word');
  });
}
